&lt;h4 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:0pt;"&gt;(5) 自己株券買付状況報告書&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;2024年６月19日近畿財務局長に提出。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:OtherReferenceInformationTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:InformationAboutCompanyWhichProvidesGuaranteeToReportingCompanyTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
